---
args: {"desk": "PublicationDesk"}
returns: "QualifiedProposition[]"
---
Read available page editions with context; for each evidence page bind fragments = interpretQualifiedClaims(source, desk.revisions). Collect independently checkable propositions with every material exception, negation, audience, jurisdiction and effective interval. Resolve entities conservatively. When a page or derived source token is denied, retain only an opaque invalidation record outside the visible proposition text. A copied page shares origin and cannot add authority. A page lacking complete text supports only the propositions actually evidenced, never unseen surrounding claims.
